     A            GTFG07    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A            GTFG08    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A            GTFG09    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A            GTFG10    R               REFFLD(FLAG)
     A*
     A            GTCF01    R               REFFLD(KEY)
